            "review_title": "Review at Rice On Rice",
            "review_text": "Kay S\n1 contribution\n0\nThe best food in NhaTrang!\nNov 2025 • Couples\nGo to this store!!\nWhether vegetarian, vegan or meat eater.\n\nBy far the best restaurant we've been to so far.\nOn our trip through Vietnam we have been to many authentic restaurants and super many of them were 5 stars, but the taste in this store was incredible. \nWith also one of the cleanest stores we were here and the entire atmosphere invites you to linger.\nIt was so delicious that I forgot to take pictures of everything. \nA really special store that stands out from many other stores. \n\nI eat meat myself and I haven't missed anything here. It was tastier than anything with meat. \n\nI am super impressed and would even say it was one of the tastiest \nRestaurants where I've been on our journey around the world until now.\n\nThanks for letting us be guests. We will definitely come back.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from German\nShow original\nWritten November 7, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-11",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
