            "review_title": "Review at Rice On Rice",
            "review_text": "tido\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam31 contributions\n0\nFirst time trying Vegan\nApr 2024 • Family\nMy very first time trying vegan cuisine. This Rice On Rice make my experience be perfect. Their minimalism style on 1st floor attract me so well. We tried 5 courses from starter to 4 people hot pot and a mocktail \n- Salad with Crunchy Morning Glory: easy to eat, sour and sweet flavor become balance at first bite\n- Square Deep Fried \"Nem\" & Fried Platter: Fried things always good, remember to try fried mushroom !!! \n- Holy Basil Fried Rice: crunchy rice on this course make the fried rice better\n- Sukiyaki Hot Pot: the broth is fantastic, it's definitely the vedette.\n- Fresh Floral Mocktail: sour flavor to clean your mouth with beautiful garnishment\nOverall, good food, good place, good music and very friendly staff ❤️\nRead more\nWritten April 6, 2024",
